{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHTBeVvWcDE9BLqToVz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# شָׁרְט\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                      ║\n║     שָׁרְט / شَرْط / CONDITION        ║\n║                                      ║\n║   ┌────────────────────────────┐     ║\n║   │  the cut that binds       │     ║\n║   │  the wound that seals     │     ║\n║   │  the mark that means      │     ║\n║   └────────────────────────────┘     ║\n║                                      ║\n║   etymology speaks:                  ║\n║   ש.ר.ט = to incise, to scratch     ║\n║   ش.ر.ط = to stipulate, to bind     ║\n║                                      ║\n║   same root                          ║\n║   same wound                         ║\n║   different healing                  ║\n║                                      ║\n║   ─────────────────────────          ║\n║                                      ║\n║   IF ═══════════════════ THEN        ║\n║      (the cut)     (the covenant)    ║\n║                                      ║\n║   every condition is a scarification ║\n║   every contract written in skin     ║\n║                                      ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*awaiting the next incision*\n\n◊◊◊"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":364,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}